{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05756","headline":"赠程秘书 · 卢象","name":"赠程秘书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"客自岐阳来，吐音若鸣凤。\n孤飞畏不偶，独立谁见用。\n忽从被褐中，召入承明宫。\n圣人借颜色，言事无不通。\n殷勤拯黎庶，感激论诸公。\n将相猜贾谊，图书归马融。\n顾余久寂寞，一岁麒麟阁。\n且共歌太平，勿嗟名宦薄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢象","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05756.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05756","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}